  <key>PayloadDescription</key><string>vProfile — one managed profile for the fleet. Notification sound OFF for all apps (banners/badges kept = visual only). Superset of fleet apps; entries for absent apps are inert. Remove anytime to restore manual control. NOTE: content-preview hiding is NOT profile-able on macOS — set System Settings > Notifications > Show previews > Never manually.</string>
